    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. One thing—the maintenance tech said it looked like a sudden electrical short in the control board, almost like something tripped the sensor out of nowhere. No signs of wear or anything. Is there a way to troubleshoot if it was a mechanical failure vs just a random glitch, or should we just assume the whole batch is a loss?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
